{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Onboarding seal (HPKE) known-answer vectors",
  "description": "onboard_ok.sealed: HPKE base mode (RFC 9180) DHKEM(X25519, HKDF-SHA256), HKDF-SHA256, ChaCha20Poly1305, sequence number 0. Case rfc9180-a.2.1-seq0 is the RFC test vector A.2.1 (first encryption); case onboard-v1 uses info \"hub/onboard/v1\", aad = session id (ASCII) and the plaintext JSON {client_id, secret}; case watch-access-v1 uses info \"hub/watch-access/v1\", aad = client_id (ASCII) and a sealed watch access (crypto/watch-access-plaintext.json, watch_access.sealed). tools/validate.py recomputes enc and ct from sk_e and checks that sk_r opens ct; the hub and the apps (CryptoKit HPKE.Recipient) open every case.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "suite",
    "kem_id",
    "kdf_id",
    "aead_id",
    "mode",
    "cases"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "suite": {
      "const": "X25519-SHA256-ChaCha20Poly1305"
    },
    "kem_id": {
      "const": 32
    },
    "kdf_id": {
      "const": 1
    },
    "aead_id": {
      "const": 3
    },
    "mode": {
      "const": 0
    },
    "cases": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 2,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "name",
          "sk_r",
          "pk_r",
          "sk_e",
          "enc",
          "info",
          "aad",
          "pt",
          "ct"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sk_r": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "pk_r": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "sk_e": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "enc": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "info": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})*$"
          },
          "aad": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})*$"
          },
          "pt": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})*$"
          },
          "ct": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^([0-9a-f]{2})*$"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
